    "body": "Implementation update: the owned-horse autonomous needs module is integrated and the combined release build passes. It currently supports authored trough drinking and validated dry hay grazing, with gradual core restoration, cooldowns, and interruption/safety gates. Natural shoreline drinking remains deliberately unimplemented because a safe placement/animation path is not yet proven. The build and its horse_need_sources.csv are queued for hash-verified installation when RDR2 closes, so this correctly remains actionable.",
